Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-flask, python3-msal, python3-jwt, python3-cryptography, gunicorn, socat, sudo, openssl, adduser, haproxy (>= 2.6), bind9-dnsutils | dnsutils
Recommends: certbot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/PriCoSoft/haproxy-admin
Description: Web UI to manage HAProxy sites and Let's Encrypt certificates
 HAProxy Admin generates the complete haproxy.cfg from a model and manages
 sites (host/path routing, servers, redirects), security (rate limiting,
 block list, trusted networks, headers), certbot certificates (HTTP-01 and
 DNS-01 with Cloudflare / IONOS) and shows the HAProxy traffic log.
 Every change is validated, previewed as a diff, backed up and rolled back
 automatically if the reload fails. Sign-in via Microsoft Entra ID.
